1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,417
How many security holes are on your PC?

2
00:00:02,567 --> 00:00:04,178
It can easily be hundreds.

3
00:00:05,328 --> 00:00:07,535
One command: mr-ducksafe scan.

4
00:00:07,685 --> 00:00:09,792
A hundred and forty-three programs scanned.

5
00:00:09,942 --> 00:00:15,275
On this PC: five hundred and twenty-five
vulnerabilities. But only fourteen actions.

6
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:21,647
No jargon. It tells you the risk in plain words,
and gives you the fix.

7
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:28,938
A single .exe, official NVD data, CI support,
and one hundred percent local.

8
00:00:30,088 --> 00:00:32,828
Free and open source. Link in the description.

